# The `-Cllvm-args` group trust-mc-driver's Trustc route passes only to the
# target package of a cargo build (`cargo rustc -- ...`). rustc concatenates it
# with cargo-dependency.llvm-args. See standalone.llvm-args.
--trust-mc-engine-args=pct1:9
--reachability=harnesses
--log-level=warn
--assertion-reach-checks
--harness
check_add
--c-lib
/opt/Application%20Support/stub.o
--default-unwind
3
